  prompt: "Implement GitHub issue #65: NetZeroCarbon UX/UI & Functional Fix Map\n\nIssue details:\n## Destination\n\nFix all 16 UX/UI issues and 9 functional bugs identified in the 2026-08-25 audit to make NetZeroCarbon production-ready. All fixes are specified with exact file paths and code changes.\n\n## Notes\n\n- **Audit report**: Complete UX/UI audit with measured WCAG contrast ratios, source-level analysis, and live browser testing\n- **Frontend stack**: Next.js 16.3, Tailwind v4, Thai-first (lang=\"th\"), Material Symbols\n- **Backend stack**: Cloudflare Workers, Hono, D1 database, R2 storage\n- **Priority order**: Functional bugs (B1-B9) block core flows, then critical UI (C1-C4), then major (M1-M6), then minor (m1-m6)\n- **Design decisions already made**:\n  - Chat bubbles: Option A (dark-green gradient #006e2b→#008a3c, white text, 4.6-4.9:1)\n  - Chat state: React Context (not sessionStorage)\n  - Sponsor mobile: Mirror admin responsive pattern (sidebar hidden lg:block)\n  - Dead controls: Remove entirely (don't implement stubs)\n\n## Decisions so far\n\n- [B1: Implement POST /api/season endpoint](https://github.com/Poom5741/netzero-app/issues/66) — Created season.ts route with POST /api/season handler, mounted in index.ts\n- [B2: Fix photo upload route prefix mismatch](https://github.com/Poom5741/netzero-app/issues/67) — Changed /photo/upload to /api/photo/upload in photo.ts\n- [B3: Fix fake GPS coordinates presented as verified](https://github.com/Poom5741/netzero-app/issues/68) — Removed fallback to demo coordinates, shows warning state when GPS unavailable\n- [B4: Add phone number validation in chat flow](https://github.com/Poom5741/netzero-app/issues/69) — Added /^0\\d{9}$/ validation in flow.ts\n- [B5: Fix 404 sidebar links (/reports, /admin/users)](https://github.com/Poom5741/netzero-app/issues/86) — Removed non-existent route links from admin and sponsor sidebars\n- [B6: Add retry button and auth hint to admin error state](https://github.com/Poom5741/netzero-app/issues/87) — Added retry button and 'กรุณาเข้าสู่ระบบ' message for 401 errors\n- [B7: Add visible validation to summary form](https://github.com/Poom5741/netzero-app/issues/88) — Added required field markers and validation messages\n- [B8: Deduplicate admin API call (2x 401)](https://github.com/Poom5741/netzero-app/issues/89) — Added ref guard to prevent duplicate fetches\n- [B9: Self-host Material Symbols font](https://github.com/Poom5741/netzero-app/issues/90) — Kept CDN link (next/font doesn't support icon fonts)\n- [C1: Fix chat bubble contrast (2.26:1 → ≥4.5:1)](https://github.com/Poom5741/netzero-app/issues/70) — Changed gradient to #006e2b→#008a3c, increased timestamp size to 13px\n- [C2: Fix sponsor dashboard mobile layout](https://github.com/Poom5741/netzero-app/issues/71) — Already had responsive classes in place\n- [C3: Fix tab navigation wiping chat history](https://github.com/Poom5741/netzero-app/issues/72) — Changed <a href> to Next.js <Link>, added sessionStorage persistence\n- [C4: Fix placeholder visibility (1.54:1 → ≥4.5:1)](https://github.com/Poom5741/netzero-app/issues/73) — Added --color-placeholder token, updated inputs\n- [M1: Fix Thai micro-type (11-12px → ≥13px)](https://github.com/Poom5741/netzero-app/issues/74) — Changed all text-xs to text-sm, increased minimum sizes\n- [M2: Add aria-live region for chat messages](https://github.com/Poom5741/netzero-app/issues/75) — Added role='log' aria-live='polite' to message container\n- [M3: Remove dead controls and 404 nav links](https://github.com/Poom5741/netzero-app/issues/76) — Removed search, notifications, settings buttons from dashboard header\n- [M4: Fix heading hierarchy and figure size collisions](https://github.com/Poom5741/netzero-app/issues/77) — Reduced h1 from 48px to 32px, KPI values to 40px, titles to 18px\n- [M5: Fix sponsor dashboard false zeros during loading](https://github.com/Poom5741/netzero-app/issues/78) — Added skeleton loading states for KPI cards\n- [M6: Add global focus-visible styles](https://github.com/Poom5741/netzero-app/issues/79) — Added 2px primary outline for keyboard navigation\n- [m1: Redirect root route to /chat](https://github.com/Poom5741/netzero-app/issues/80) — Replaced page.tsx with redirect\n- [m2: Deduplicate admin API fetch on mount](https://github.com/Poom5741/netzero-app/issues/81) — Same fix as B8\n- [m3: Add missing color tokens to globals.css](https://github.com/Poom5741/netzero-app/issues/82) — Added --color-on-error-container and --color-on-tertiary-container\n- [m4: Localize dashboard UI to Thai](https://github.com/Poom5741/netzero-app/issues/83) — Changed English text to Thai (Review Queue, System Admin, Q3 2024, etc.)\n- [m5: Relabel 'real-time' as static or add polling](https://github.com/Poom5741/netzero-app/issues/84) — Removed 'เรียลไทม์' labels, removed pulse animations\n- [m6: Add unique document titles per route](https://github.com/Poom5741/netzero-app/issues/85) — Added layout.tsx files with metadata for each route\n\n## Not yet specified\n\n- Whether to self-host Material Symbols font (B9) or keep Google Fonts CDN\n- Whether to implement /reports and /admin/users routes (B5) or just remove links\n- Whether to add real-time polling for sponsor dashboard (m5) or just relabel as static\n\n## Out of scope\n\n- Brand redesign (audit explicitly out of scope)\n- Backend architecture changes beyond the specified route fixes\n- Recruiting test participants (audit recommended follow-up)\n\nInstructions:\n1. Read and understand the issue requirements\n2. Implement the changes in the codebase\n3. Write or update tests if applicable\n4. Run typecheck and tests to verify your changes work\n5. Commit your changes with a message starting with #65:\n6. Make sure all tests pass before finishing\n\nFocus on making the minimal correct changes to satisfy the issue requirements.\n",
